exports[`asRouteGuardPartitionCoverageLines given: [case1] a stone whose @all set holds, one partition literally named rest when: [t0] the coverage is rendered then: it matches the snapshot 1`] = `
"🦉 coverage read — naught written, no review run

🗿 route.guard.partition
   ├─ route = .behavior/v2026_01_01.demo
   ├─ stone = 5.1.execution
   ├─ checked against 5 files changed since main
   └─ scope @all — read by r1, r2
      ├─ partitions
      │  ├─ review: 0 narrow targets + 2 common targets · ~2,000 tokens of file bodies, ~2,000 common
      │  ├─ route: 0 narrow targets + 3 common targets · ~3,000 tokens of file bodies, ~3,000 common
      │  └─ rest: 1 narrow target + 4 common targets · ~5,000 tokens of file bodies, ~4,000 common
      │     └─ src/utils/new/asWidget.ts
